In article <589@opus.NMSU.EDU> cgoret@nmsu.edu (Clay Goret) writes:
>I just had a very weird experience concerning a fountain.  I was on
>the first level, and I drank from a fountain, and I recieved the following
>message :
>This waters no good -
>So I drank again, and got
>This water gives you bad breath -
>The fountain dries up.
>
>Now I look in my pack, and several items are now cursed (like a potion of 
>holy water to unholy water, an uncursed scroll of light to a cursed scroll
>of light, etc.)
>
>Is this a feature or a bug?

It's a feature. WHen you see the message:
  This water's no good!
means that something, or more items got cursed. The other message
  This water gives you bad breath
means you have scare monster, as you could think.
Other iteresting thinks are
  You have a feeling of loss
you don't actually lose something, it means that the fountain wanted
to uncurse one of your items, but that it was already cursed. Finding
gems, gold, losing gold, summoning demons and water elementals speak for
themselves. The other things, homesickness, strange tingling, etc are just
messages without consequences


